<title>HONG KONG: Tem Fat Hing Fung H1 net up 5.35 pct.</title>
<headline>Tem Fat Hing Fung H1 net up 5.35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended October 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.36	vs 5.01</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.0	 vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  32.0 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    54.53     vs 51.76</p>
<p>    Turnover		     4,133.74 vs 3,371.28</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tem Fat Hing Fung (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  February 13-17</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   February 28</p>
<p>NOTE - Tem Fat Hing Fung is a bullion, jewellery and property company.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on partial disposal of a subsidiary to an independent third party.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
